<span class="line"><span style="color:#7F848E;font-style:italic;">     * </span><span style="color:#C678DD;font-style:italic;">@param</span><span style="color:#E06C75;font-style:italic;"> memory_threshold</span><span style="color:#7F848E;font-style:italic;"> 可选参数。当写入数据的大小超过该值时，</span></span>
